{#- OpenAI streaming terminal sequence.
    Emitted after the last content chunk. Frames, in order:
      1. Empty-delta chunk carrying finish_reason: "stop"
      2. (Optional) Usage-only chunk when stream_options.include_usage is true
      3. [DONE] sentinel
    Blank lines between frames are required by the SSE spec so SDK parsers
    treat each as a distinct event.

    Blank lines appear as empty lines in the rendered output; the
    raw-frame renderer preserves them as SSE frame separators. -#}
